OL,3,GNEWSARoad to close for lorry-damaged
OL,4,Abridge repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA road will be closed for two weeks so
OL,7,Fa bridge damaged by a lorry can be
OL,8,Frepaired.
OL,10,FThe lorry struck the bridge on Church
OL,11,FRoad in Swallowfield, Berkshire, on 11
OL,12,FFebruary, smashing one side of the
OL,13,Fbrick wall and forcing the road to
OL,14,Fclose for more than two weeks.
OL,16,FWokingham Borough Council, which owns
OL,17,Fthe bridge, previously said in a
OL,18,FFreedom of Information request that
OL,19,Frepair work was expected to cost
OL,20,F#60,000.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
