OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSARoad to close for lorry-damaged
OL,4,Abridge repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said repairs to the bridge
OL,7,Fwould begin on Monday 28 September,
OL,8,Fwith a road closure required so that
OL,9,Fthe parapet could be replaced safely.
OL,10,FIt added that it was "making every
OL,11,Feffort to recover costs from the party
OL,12,Fresponsible" and "working with their
OL,13,Finsurers".
